## 8. Data gaps & caveats

- The filings extract provided no business description, and the Yahoo Finance analysis page contained only navigation text, a quote and an empty Growth Estimates table.
- No management or analyst growth estimates, and no risk-factor disclosures in the filings analysis.
- No income statement breakdown, so the drivers of net income exceeding operating income are unknown.
- No capex split between growth and maintenance, and no depreciation, asset-sale or lease-term data.
- No debt maturity schedule, interest cost, covenant or liquidity detail in the structured data.
- No quarterly data, guidance, buyback or dividend figures in the structured data. These come only from secondary qualitative sources.
- The Debt/Equity unit basis is unclear, and management's 2.05x leverage is not reconciled with the market-data 2.33.
- The three EPS bases (about $23.9, $20.4 and $16.80) are not reconciled, and the forward P/E appears to rest on estimates above company guidance.
- Qualitative claims (guidance, buybacks, Russia recoveries, utilization) come from earnings-call summaries, news and a third-party profile. The 99% utilization figure is from 2024. Details were not independently verified.
- Minor price discrepancy: $143.85 (MARKET DATA) versus $143.91 (Yahoo quote).

